The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2024 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in San Diego CA. W-2 from Desert Sun Logistics: $91,000. Additional income: $15,000 (IT contracting, 2 clients), $1,780 from Marcus s..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


